[gd_scene load_steps=4 format=3 uid="uid://unitmaterialemissionhdr"]

; An emission colour with a channel above 1, from Godot's HDR colour picker. Godot converts
; sRGB to linear before energy multiplies it, taking the pow branch above 0.04045, so 2.0
; extrapolates to 4.954 rather than clipping to 1. Normalising by the peak first, or clamping,
; moves the red channel and the hue, and changes how much blooms, since the glow gates on the peak.

